WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.070
First job is simple: read.

2
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.500
Pages one through six — the Introduction.

3
00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:09.250
No notes yet, no highlighting. Just read.

4
00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.760
Pay attention to what the author says it means

5
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.590
to use AI 'with intention' —

6
00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.300
that phrase is the whole ballgame.

7
00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.655
And keep an eye out for the two cries

8
00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:19.830
for help he says teachers post the most.

9
00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.660
You might recognize one of them.
